flowchart TD
  subgraph Client
    UI["HR Manager (Web Browser)"]
  end
  
  subgraph Frontend Container
    NextJS["Next.js Application (React, Tailwind UI)"]
  end
  
  subgraph Backend Container
    FastAPI["FastAPI Web Server (Python, REST API)"]
  end
  
  subgraph Background Processing
    Redis["Redis (Message Broker)"]
    Celery["Celery Worker (Async Tasks)"]
  end
  
  subgraph Data Storage
    PG["PostgreSQL Database (Relational Data)"]
  end

  UI -->|HTTP / REST| NextJS
  NextJS -->|HTTP / REST| FastAPI
  
  FastAPI -->|Read / Write| PG
  FastAPI -->|Push Heavy Task| Redis
  
  Redis -->|Consume Task| Celery
  Celery -->|Execute Bulk Operations| PG
